@port = 3000
@url = http://localhost:{{port}}
@menuId = 1
@orderId = 1

### Health check
GET {{url}}/health

### Current menu should only return current versions
GET {{url}}/api/menu

### Admin/owner: create a new version instead of overwriting the old row
PATCH {{url}}/api/menu/{{menuId}}
content-type: application/json

{
  "price": 55,
  "changeReason": "V10 versioning verification"
}

### Staff/chef/owner/admin: inspect all versions for one logical item
GET {{url}}/api/menu/{{menuId}}/history

### Customer: stale-cart verification
### 1. Add an item to a pending cart.
### 2. Update that menu item above so the cart points to an old version.
### 3. Submit should return HTTP 409 MENU_VERSION_OUTDATED.
POST {{url}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/submit
content-type: application/json

{}
